\label{lemma-cartesian-map-hilbert}
In the situation of
Lemma \ref{lemma-map-hilbert}
assume that the given square is $2$-cartesian. Then the diagram
$$
\xymatrix{
\mathcal{H}_d(\mathcal{X}'/\mathcal{Y}') \ar[r] \ar[d] &
\mathcal{H}_d(\mathcal{X}/\mathcal{Y}) \ar[d] \\
\mathcal{Y}' \ar[r] &
\mathcal{Y}
}
$$
is $2$-cartesian.
